EasyWeek is an easy-to-manage online appointment scheduler made to automate your business from the service industry.

Managing business processes has become so easy! A client can book an appointment for a service with a company or a private specialist at any convenient time, independently choose a master and the service in a few clicks.

EasyWeek is not only an app for appointments, it is also an ecosystem for customer acquisition. Namely, an online appointment widget, an online page that can replace a full website.

Manage your client base, keep count and analyze your business with us. EasyWeek mobile application is designed for beauty salons, barbershops, medical centers, vet clinics, studios, cosmetology etc.

We save your time and provide information about appointments and clients online.

ONLINE APPOINTMENT SCHEDULING

- 24/7 online appointment scheduling capability;
- online appointments via Facebook, Google Business, Google Maps, Instagram etc.;
- appointments from the website;

APPOINTMENT LOG

- individual schedule for employees;
- intuitive and understandable interface;
- salon management system;
- minimizing of errors in the appointment log;
- scheduling return visits;

CLIENT BASE

- instant search of client information;
- the full history of customer visits;
- loyalty programs;
- sms-notifications and reminders;

STATISTICS AND ANALYTICS
- report on appointments, salaries, finance and productive;
- tracking the dynamics of business development;
- export;

EMPLOYEE MANAGEMENT

- automatic payroll;
- employee performance metrics;
- system of notifications.

Mobile application also works on all devices and operating systems. Registration in the EasyWeek service is required to use the application.


